WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.508 --> 00:00:05.833
- [Narrator] Opened in
1962, the TWA Terminal,

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:09.001
also known as T5,
embodied the spirit of the

00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:10.751
Golden Age of flying.

00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:15.585
It was closed to the public
in 2001 and now sits abandoned

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:18.089
at one of the busiest hubs in the world,

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:20.922
New York's John F Kennedy Airport.

00:00:22.865 --> 00:00:25.782
(thoughtful music)

